Package: escapeR
Type: Package
Title: Escape Room Adventures for Learning R in Ecological Statistics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tiago", "Marques", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tiago.marques@st-andrews.ac.uk"),
    person("OpenAI", "Codex", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: A lightweight classroom game where students learn R by solving
    ecological-statistics puzzles inside a virtual escape room. The package
    remembers each player's progress, offers hints, and uses tasks inspired by
    introductory R teaching material, numerical ecology, ecological modelling,
    and distance sampling.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/TiagoAMarques/escapeR
BugReports: https://github.com/TiagoAMarques/escapeR/issues
